    <description>DiskGeek shows what is actually taking up the space on a drive, as a sortable tree rather than a
picture you have to interpret.

* Scan a whole drive or any folder
* Sort by size at every level, so the largest thing is always one click away
* Find duplicate files and the biggest files on the disk
* Open a folder in Explorer straight from the results
* No account, no adverts, no bundled offers

Free for personal and commercial use. The .NET 8 runtime is bundled, so there is nothing to install
first.</description>
    <summary>Free disk space analyser for Windows - find what is actually filling the drive</summary>
